hentication has response status 401, a non-holder receives response status 403, and a conflicting release has response status 409.\",\n  \"when\": \"The holder sends those dates to `POST /parking/releases`.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-3\",\n  \"given\": \"An authenticated holder owns an existing unclaimed scheduled release.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.5\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the returned release has status `Cancelled` and includes audit events for scheduling and cancellation; missing authentication has response status 401, a non-holder receives response status 403, an unknown identifier has response status 404, and a claimed or otherwise conflicting release has response status 409.\",\n  \"when\": \"The holder sends `DELETE /parking/releases/{releaseId}`.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-3\",\n  \"given\": \"A dedicated holder submits a malformed date or a date outside the configured scheduling window.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.6\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is the contract-declared 400 for invalid input or 409 for the applicable state conflict, and the response body conforms to the contract `ApiError` schema.\",\n  \"when\": \"The holder sends the date to `POST /parking/releases`.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"stubs\" kind=\"stubs\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"path\": \"App.Api/Auth/IGoogleIdentityTokenVerifier.cs\",\n  \"content\": \"using System.Threading;\\nusing System.Threading.Tasks;\\n\\nnamespace App.Api.Auth;\\n\\npublic interface IGoogleIdentityTokenVerifier\\n{\\n    Task<(string Email, string Name)?> VerifyAsync(string googleIdentityToken, CancellationToken cancellationToken);\\n}\\n\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<pointers>\n- App.Api/Program.cs: the code these criteria are about\n- contracts/openapi.yaml: the code these criteria are about\n- App.Api/AppDb.cs: the code these criteria are about\n- App.Api/SeedData.cs: the code these criteria are about\n</pointers>\n\nWrite the acceptance a